<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="A practical, bilingual cheat sheet for clearer and more useful WhatsApp group chats."
    />
    <meta name="color-scheme" content="light" />
    <title>WhatsApp Group Cheat Sheet | WhatsApp Gruppen-Spickzettel</title>

    <style>
      :root {
        --ink: #10231d;
        --muted: #5c6d66;
        --paper: #f8f7f2;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --line: #dfe7e2;
        --green: #167d53;
        --green-dark: #075e54;
        --green-pale: #dff7e9;
        --lime: #c7f36f;
        --yellow: #fff1ae;
        --coral: #ffb8a8;
        --blue: #cae8ff;
        --shadow: 0 18px 55px rgba(7, 55, 43, 0.1);
        --radius-lg: 30px;
        --radius-md: 20px;
        --radius-sm: 13px;
        --max-width: 1160px;
      }

      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }

      html {
        scroll-behavior: smooth;
      }

      body {
        margin: 0;
        color: var(--ink);
        background:
          radial-gradient(circle at 8% 4%, rgba(199, 243, 111, 0.24), transparent 22rem),
          radial-gradient(circle at 95% 18%, rgba(202, 232, 255, 0.3), transparent 25rem),
          var(--paper);
        font-family:
          Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont,
          "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
        line-height: 1.55;
        text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
      }

      button,
      a {
        -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
      }

      a {
        color: var(--green-dark);
        text-decoration-thickness: 0.09em;
        text-underline-offset: 0.18em;
      }

      a:hover {
        color: var(--green);
      }

      button:focus-visible,
      a:focus-visible,
      summary:focus-visible {
        outline: 3px solid rgba(22, 125, 83, 0.28);
        outline-offset: 3px;
      }

      .shell {
        width: min(calc(100% - 34px), var(--max-width));
        margin-inline: auto;
      }

      .topbar {
        position: sticky;
        z-index: 20;
        top: 0;
        border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(223, 231, 226, 0.9);
        background: rgba(248, 247, 242, 0.9);
        backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
      }

      .topbar-inner {
        min-height: 70px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .mini-brand {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 10px;
        color: var(--ink);
        font-weight: 800;
        letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      }

      .brand-mark {
        width: 35px;
        aspect-ratio: 1;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 50% 50% 50% 12%;
        color: white;
        background: var(--green);
        font-size: 18px;
        transform: rotate(-3deg);
      }

      .top-actions,
      .language-switch {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 7px;
      }

      .language-switch {
        padding: 4px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: white;
      }

      .language-switch button,
      .print-button {
        min-height: 40px;
        border: 0;
        border-radius: 999px;
        font: inherit;
        font-weight: 800;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .language-switch button {
        min-width: 49px;
        padding: 7px 12px;
        color: var(--muted);
        background: transparent;
      }

      .language-switch button[aria-pressed="true"] {
        color: white;
        background: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .print-button {
        padding: 8px 16px;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: white;
      }

      .print-button:hover {
        background: var(--green-pale);
      }

      main {
        overflow: hidden;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: clamp(58px, 9vw, 112px) 0 58px;
      }

      .hero-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.25fr) minmax(300px, 0.75fr);
        align-items: center;
        gap: clamp(34px, 7vw, 90px);
      }

      .eyebrow {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 9px;
        margin: 0 0 20px;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        font-size: 0.79rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.13em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .eyebrow::before {
        content: "";
        width: 11px;
        height: 11px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--green);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 6px var(--green-pale);
      }

      h1,
      h2,
      h3,
      p {
        margin-top: 0;
      }

      h1 {
        max-width: 780px;
        margin-bottom: 24px;
        font-size: clamp(3.2rem, 8.2vw, 7.1rem);
        line-height: 0.91;
        letter-spacing: -0.075em;
      }

      h1 span {
        color: var(--green);
      }

      .hero-copy {
        max-width: 690px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: clamp(1.06rem, 2vw, 1.28rem);
      }

      .chips {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 9px;
      }

      .chip {
        padding: 8px 13px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.72);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
        font-weight: 750;
      }

      .phone-demo {
        position: relative;
        max-width: 370px;
        margin-inline: auto;
        padding: 25px 18px 20px;
        border: 9px solid var(--ink);
        border-radius: 42px;
        background: #ece8df;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        transform: rotate(2deg);
      }

      .phone-demo::before {
        content: "";
        position: absolute;
        top: 9px;
        left: 50%;
        width: 32%;
        height: 7px;
        border-radius: 999px;
        background: var(--ink);
        transform: translateX(-50%);
      }

      .chat-header {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 11px;
        margin: 8px -18px 20px;
        padding: 12px 18px;
        color: white;
        background: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .avatar {
        width: 36px;
        height: 36px;
        display: grid;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        place-items: center;
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        background: var(--lime);
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .chat-name {
        line-height: 1.2;
      }

      .chat-name strong,
      .chat-name small {
        display: block;
      }

      .chat-name small {
        margin-top: 3px;
        opacity: 0.74;
      }

      .bubble {
        width: fit-content;
        max-width: 88%;
        margin-bottom: 11px;
        padding: 10px 12px 8px;
        border-radius: 6px 17px 17px 17px;
        background: white;
        box-shadow: 0 3px 14px rgba(28, 44, 37, 0.08);
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .bubble.me {
        margin-left: auto;
        border-radius: 17px 6px 17px 17px;
        background: #d8fdd2;
      }

      .bubble .name {
        display: block;
        margin-bottom: 3px;
        color: var(--green);
        font-size: 0.74rem;
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .bubble small {
        float: right;
        margin: 4px 0 0 12px;
        color: #708079;
        font-size: 0.66rem;
      }

      .reply-quote {
        margin-bottom: 7px;
        padding: 7px 8px;
        border-left: 3px solid var(--green);
        border-radius: 6px;
        color: #52615b;
        background: rgba(7, 94, 84, 0.07);
        font-size: 0.75rem;
      }

      .floating-label {
        position: absolute;
        right: -24px;
        bottom: 76px;
        padding: 9px 13px;
        border: 3px solid var(--ink);
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: var(--yellow);
        font-weight: 900;
        transform: rotate(-4deg);
      }

      .section {
        padding: 48px 0;
      }

      .section-heading {
        max-width: 750px;
        margin-bottom: 28px;
      }

      .section-heading h2 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: clamp(2rem, 4.5vw, 3.7rem);
        line-height: 1;
        letter-spacing: -0.055em;
      }

      .section-heading p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 1.05rem;
      }

      .chooser {
        padding: clamp(25px, 4vw, 42px);
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        background: var(--card);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }

      .chooser-options {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 10px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .choice-button,
      .filter-button,
      .copy-button {
        min-height: 48px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 999px;
        color: var(--ink);
        background: white;
        font: inherit;
        font-weight: 800;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .choice-button {
        padding: 10px 17px;
      }

      .choice-button:hover,
      .choice-button[aria-pressed="true"] {
        border-color: var(--green-dark);
        color: white;
        background: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .choice-result {
        display: none;
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 17px;
        min-height: 116px;
        padding: 19px;
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        background: var(--green-pale);
      }

      .choice-result.active {
        display: grid;
      }

      .result-icon,
      .card-number {
        display: grid;
        flex: 0 0 auto;
        place-items: center;
        color: white;
        background: var(--green-dark);
        font-weight: 900;
      }

      .result-icon {
        width: 66px;
        height: 66px;
        border-radius: 18px;
        font-size: 1.45rem;
      }

      .choice-result h3 {
        margin-bottom: 3px;
        font-size: 1.28rem;
      }

      .choice-result p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: #40574e;
      }

      .filters {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 8px;
        margin-bottom: 22px;
      }

      .filter-button {
        min-height: 43px;
        padding: 8px 14px;
      }

      .filter-button:hover,
      .filter-button[aria-pressed="true"] {
        border-color: var(--ink);
        color: white;
        background: var(--ink);
      }

      .card-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 15px;
      }

      .tip-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        background: var(--card);
        overflow: clip;
        transition:
          transform 180ms ease,
          box-shadow 180ms ease;
      }

      .tip-card:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 15px 30px rgba(7, 55, 43, 0.08);
      }

      .tip-card[hidden] {
        display: none;
      }

      .tip-card details {
        height: 100%;
      }

      .tip-card summary {
        min-height: 154px;
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: auto 1fr auto;
        align-items: start;
        gap: 15px;
        padding: 22px;
        list-style: none;
        cursor: pointer;
      }

      .tip-card summary::-webkit-details-marker {
        display: none;
      }

      .card-number {
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
      }

      .tip-card:nth-child(4n + 2) .card-number {
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--yellow);
      }

      .tip-card:nth-child(4n + 3) .card-number {
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--blue);
      }

      .tip-card:nth-child(4n + 4) .card-number {
        color: var(--ink);
        background: var(--coral);
      }

      .card-title h3 {
        margin-bottom: 5px;
        font-size: 1.15rem;
        line-height: 1.25;
      }

      .card-title p {
        margin-bottom: 0;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.93rem;
      }

      .expand-icon {
        width: 30px;
        height: 30px;
        display: grid;
        place-items: center;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: 50%;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        transition: transform 180ms ease;
      }

      details[open] .expand-icon {
        transform: rotate(45deg);
      }

      .card-detail {
        padding: 0 22px 22px 77px;
        color: #354c43;
      }

      .card-detail ol,
      .card-detail ul {
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
      }

      .card-detail li + li {
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .card-detail .why {
        padding: 12px 14px;
        border-radius: 12px;
        background: #f3f5f1;
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }

      .card-link {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 6px;
        margin-top: 8px;
        font-weight: 800;
      }

      .divider-label {
        display: inline-block;
        margin: 18px 0 9px;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        font-size: 0.77rem;
        font-weight: 900;
        letter-spacing: 0.08em;
        text-transform: uppercase;
      }

      .rule-grid {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.05fr) minmax(290px, 0.95fr);
        gap: 18px;
      }

      .rules-card,
      .traffic-card {
        padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 38px);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
      }

      .rules-card {
        color: white;
        background: var(--green-dark);
      }

      .rules-card h2,
      .traffic-card h2 {
        margin-bottom: 10px;
        font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3vw, 2.7rem);
        line-height: 1.05;
        letter-spacing: -0.045em;
      }

      .rules-card > p {
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
      }

      .copy-box {
        margin-top: 21px;
        padding: 20px;
        border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        border-radius: var(--radius-md);
        color: var(--ink);
        background: white;
      }

      .copy-box ul {
        margin: 0;
        padding-left: 1.25rem;
      }

      .copy-box li + li {
        margin-top: 6px;
      }

      .copy-row {
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 12px;
        margin-top: 17px;
      }

      .copy-button {
        padding: 10px 17px;
        border-color: transparent;
        color: var(--green-dark);
        background: var(--lime);
      }

      .copy-button:hover {
        background: #d8ff88;
      }

      .copy-status {
        min-height: 1.5em;
        color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.75);
        font-size: 0.88rem;
      }

      .traffic-card {
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        background: white;
      }

      .traffic-list {
        display: grid;
        gap: 13px;
        margin-top: 22px;
      }

      .traffic-item {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: 16px 1fr;
        gap: 13px;
        align-items: start;
      }

      .traffic-dot {
        width: 15px;
        height: 15px;
        margin-top: 5px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        background: var(--green);
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px var(--green-pale);
      }

      .traffic-item:nth-child(2) .traffic-dot {
        background: #e4a400;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #fff4ce;
      }

      .traffic-item:nth-child(3) .traffic-dot {
        background: #d14e4e;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 5px #ffe1dd;
      }

      .traffic-item strong,
      .traffic-item span {
        display: block;
      }

      .traffic-item span {
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.92rem;
      }

      .sources {
        padding: 31px;
        border: 1px solid var(--line);
        border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7);
      }

      .sources h2 {
        margin-bottom: 9px;
        font-size: 1.55rem;
      }

      .sources > p {
        color: var(--muted);
      }

      .source-links {
        display: grid;
        grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
        gap: 9px 20px;
        padding-left: 1.2rem;
      }

      footer {
        padding: 36px 0 48px;
        color: var(--muted);
        font-size: 0.86rem;
      }

      .footer-inner {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        gap: 24px;
        border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
        padding-top: 22px;
      }

      .lang-de {
        display: none;
      }

      body[data-language="de"] .lang-en {
        display: none !important;
      }

      body[data-language="de"] .lang-de {
        display: revert;
      }

      @media (max-width: 850px) {
        .hero-grid,
        .rule-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .phone-demo {
          margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .card-grid {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .source-links {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }
      }

      @media (max-width: 570px) {
        .shell {
          width: min(calc(100% - 22px), var(--max-width));
        }

        .topbar-inner {
          min-height: 64px;
        }

        .mini-brand .brand-text,
        .print-label {
          position: absolute;
          width: 1px;
          height: 1px;
          padding: 0;
          margin: -1px;
          overflow: hidden;
          clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
          white-space: nowrap;
          border: 0;
        }

        .print-button {
          width: 40px;
          padding: 8px;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: clamp(3rem, 17vw, 5.4rem);
        }

        .hero {
          padding-top: 48px;
        }

        .floating-label {
          right: -5px;
        }

        .chooser-options {
          display: grid;
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        .choice-button {
          border-radius: 14px;
          text-align: left;
        }

        .choice-result {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr;
        }

        .result-icon {
          width: 50px;
          height: 50px;
        }

        .tip-card summary {
          min-height: 0;
          grid-template-columns: auto 1fr;
        }

        .expand-icon {
          display: none;
        }

        .card-detail {
          padding-left: 22px;
        }

        .footer-inner {
          display: block;
        }
      }

      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
        html {
          scroll-behavior: auto;
        }

        *,
        *::before,
        *::after {
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
          transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
          animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        }
      }

      @media print {
        :root {
          --paper: white;
        }

        body {
          background: white;
          font-size: 10.5pt;
        }

        .topbar,
        .phone-demo,
        .chooser,
        .filters,
        .copy-row,
        .screen-only {
          display: none !important;
        }

        .hero {
          padding: 18mm 0 10mm;
        }

        .hero-grid,
        .card-grid,
        .rule-grid,
        .source-links {
          grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
        }

        h1 {
          font-size: 44pt;
        }

        .section {
          padding: 7mm 0;
        }

        .tip-card,
        .rules-card,
        .traffic-card,
        .sources {
          break-inside: avoid;
          box-shadow: none;
        }

        .tip-card .card-detail {
          display: block !important;
        }

        .tip-card summary {
          min-height: 0;
        }

        .expand-icon {
          display: none;
        }

        a {
          color: inherit;
          text-decoration: none;
        }

        footer {
          padding-bottom: 0;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body data-language="en">
    <header class="topbar">
      <div class="shell topbar-inner">
        <div class="mini-brand" aria-label="WhatsApp group guide">
          <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
          <span class="brand-text">
            <span class="lang-en">Group chat guide</span>
            <span class="lang-de">Gruppenchat-Guide</span>
          </span>
        </div>

        <div class="top-actions">
          <button class="print-button" type="button" id="printButton">
            <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
            <span class="print-label lang-en"> Print / save PDF</span>
            <span class="print-label lang-de"> Drucken / als PDF</span>
          </button>
          <div class="language-switch" aria-label="Choose language">
            <button type="button" data-set-language="en" aria-pressed="true">EN</button>
            <button type="button" data-set-language="de" aria-pressed="false">DE</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <main>
      <section class="hero">
        <div class="shell hero-grid">
          <div>
            <p class="eyebrow">
              <span class="lang-en">Practical cheat sheet · Updated August 2026</span>
              <span class="lang-de">Praktischer Spickzettel · Stand August 2026</span>
            </p>

            <div class="lang-en">
              <h1>Less noise.<br /><span>Better chats.</span></h1>
              <p class="hero-copy">
                Use the right WhatsApp feature for the job—and keep group conversations
                clear, useful and kind.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="lang-de">
              <h1>Weniger Chaos.<br /><span>Bessere Chats.</span></h1>
              <p class="hero-copy">
                Nutze für jede Aufgabe die passende WhatsApp-Funktion – damit
                Gruppenchats klar, nützlich und freundlich bleiben.
              </p>
            </div>

            <div class="chips" aria-label="Useful for">
              <span class="chip lang-en">Churches</span>
              <span class="chip lang-en">Clubs</span>
              <span class="chip lang-en">Teams</span>
              <span class="chip lang-en">Families</span>
              <span class="chip lang-de">Kirchen</span>
              <span class="chip lang-de">Vereine</span>
              <span class="chip lang-de">Teams</span>
              <span class="chip lang-de">Familien</span>
            </div>
          </div>

